{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/extreme-value-theory/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"evt-finance-risk","title":"金融风险 VaR/ES","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/extreme-value-theory/practice/evt-finance-risk","wordCount":1434,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"evt-hydrology-climate","title":"水文与气候","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/extreme-value-theory/practice/evt-hydrology-climate","wordCount":1402,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"evt-pitfalls","title":"极值分析陷阱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/extreme-value-theory/practice/evt-pitfalls","wordCount":1621,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"实践\">实践</h1><p>理论与估计方法的真正考验，是它们能否在真实战场上做出比拍脑袋更可靠的决策。本章把前三章的工具交付到三个最依赖极值的领域，每篇都对照该领域的行话、监管要求与数据特性。</p>\n<p><a href=\"evt-finance-risk\">金融风险 VaR/ES</a> 讲极值理论如何度量市场尾部风险。Basel III 的 FRTB 框架已把内部模型的风险度量从 99% VaR 切换到 97.5% 期望损失（ES），而 ES 恰恰是 EVT 的主场——GPD 尾部能给出比经验分布更稳定的 VaR/ES 外推。本篇也讲清 EVT 与 GARCH 波动率建模如何互补。</p>\n<p><a href=\"evt-hydrology-climate\">水文与气候</a> 回到极值理论的发源地。设计洪水、IDF 曲线、百年一遇水位，这些工程概念本就是回归水平的别名；而气候变化让&quot;平稳性已死&quot;，非平稳 GEV 成为前沿。本篇也覆盖可靠性工程中&quot;最弱环节&quot;的 Weibull 视角。</p>\n<p><a href=\"evt-pitfalls\">极值分析陷阱</a> 是一份用失败案例写成的清单：阈值选偏、忽略数据依赖导致聚簇、把重现期当成&quot;保证 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 年内只发生一次&quot;、对非平稳数据强套平稳模型……每一条都对应着现实中代价高昂的误判。</p>\n<p>本章不再推导新理论，只示范如何选型、如何避坑。需要回顾方法细节时，请回到<a href=\"../models/\">模型</a>与<a href=\"../estimation/\">估计</a>章，本篇会用相对链接随时指回去。</p>\n"}